{"id":"ip-netconf.8","n":"ip-netconf","s":"8","src":{"r":{"pkg":"iproute","ver":"6.11.0-1.el9","repo":"BaseOS","url":"https://dl.rockylinux.org/vault/rocky/9.6/BaseOS/x86_64/os/Packages/i/iproute-6.11.0-1.el9.x86_64.rpm","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/ip-netconf.8.gz","sha256":"c9775add91d65b00954e7714e1f3f184ea72f71332dac5e97f3e7050509ff4f8","date":"13 Dec 2012","origin":"iproute2"},"u":{"pkg":"iproute2","ver":"5.15.0-1ubuntu2.2","repo":"jammy-updates/main","url":"http://archive.ubuntu.com/ubuntu/pool/main/i/iproute2/iproute2_5.15.0-1ubuntu2.2_amd64.deb","path":"/usr/share/man/man8/ip-netconf.8.gz","sha256":"9e9d6354e9d32683e56191ef6638e37e73698daa9b7765e2563b38eff34b0890","date":"13 Dec 2012","origin":"iproute2"}},"nopt":{"r":0,"u":0},"desc":"network configuration monitoring","same":true,"doc":[["NAME","<p>ip-netconf - network configuration monitoring</p>"],["SYNOPSIS","<br> <p><b>ip </b> [ ip-OPTIONS ] <b>netconf show</b> [ <b>dev</b> <i>NAME</i> ]</p>"],["DESCRIPTION","<p>The <b>ip netconf</b> utility can monitor IPv4 and IPv6 parameters (see <b>/proc/sys/net/ipv[4|6]/conf/[all|DEV]/</b>) like forwarding, rp_filter, proxy_neigh, ignore_routes_with_linkdown or mc_forwarding status.</p> <p>If no interface is specified, the entry <b>all</b> is displayed.</p>   <h3>ip netconf show - display network parameters</h3> <dl><dt><b>dev</b><i> NAME</i></dt><dd>the name of the device to display network parameters for.</dd></dl>"],["SEE ALSO","<p><b>ip</b>(8)</p>"],["AUTHOR","<p>Original Manpage by Nicolas Dichtel &lt;nicolas.dichtel@6wind.com&gt;</p>"]]}